    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nRespecting the values of 'ignorecase' and 'smartcase' is a [documented behavior](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/78a4d457718060fe80480c72a7d64f6b23472d63/doc/mini-jump.txt#L21-L24) and probably won't change. It doesn't look like adding too much deal breaking functionality compared to the maintenance resulting from adding this configurability.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
